---
// One smoke run, step by step.
---

<figure class="fig">
            <div style="border: 1px solid var(--rule); background: var(--card); padding: 20px; min-width: 0">
              <div style="display: grid; gap: 8px">
                <div style="border: 1px solid var(--rule); background: var(--paper); padding: 10px 12px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 12px; min-width: 0; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.4">
                  <span style="font: 500 11.5px/1.4 var(--mono); color: var(--accent-ink)">1 · at the root</span>
                  <code style="font: 500 12px/1.4 var(--mono); overflow-wrap: anywhere">setup_models.py</code>
                  <span style="color: var(--muted)">Upstream code and weights into the shared <code>weights/</code>, checked against the lock</span>
                </div>
                <span aria-hidden="true" style="justify-self: center; font: 500 15px/1 var(--mono); color: var(--muted)">↓</span>
                <div style="border: 1px dashed var(--muted); padding: 12px; display: grid; gap: 10px; min-width: 0">
                  <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4px 10px"><code style="font: 600 12.5px/1.3 var(--mono)">$DTB_ROOT/smoke/</code><span style="font: 500 11.5px/1.4 var(--mono); color: var(--muted)">never reported</span></div>
                  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: var(--f-dir); gap: 8px; align-items: stretch">
                    <div style="flex: var(--f-item); border: 1px solid var(--rule); background: var(--paper); padding: 10px; display: grid; gap: 5px; align-content: start; min-width: 0; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.4"><span style="font: 500 11.5px/1.4 var(--mono); color: var(--accent-ink)">2</span><code style="font: 500 12px/1.4 var(--mono); overflow-wrap: anywhere">setup_datasets.py --sample 2</code><span style="color: var(--muted)">2 real and 2 fake per dataset, then the manifest</span></div>
                    <span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; align-self: center; font: 500 15px/1 var(--mono); color: var(--muted)"><i class="arr"></i></span>
                    <div style="flex: var(--f-item); border: 1px solid var(--rule); background: var(--paper); padding: 10px; display: grid; gap: 5px; align-content: start; min-width: 0; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.4"><span style="font: 500 11.5px/1.4 var(--mono); color: var(--accent-ink)">3</span><code style="font: 500 12px/1.4 var(--mono); overflow-wrap: anywhere">score.py --smoke</code><span style="color: var(--muted)">Detect, crop, score; keep 4 crops per item</span></div>
                    <span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; align-self: center; font: 500 15px/1 var(--mono); color: var(--muted)"><i class="arr"></i></span>
                    <div style="flex: var(--f-item); border: 1px solid var(--rule); background: var(--paper); padding: 10px; display: grid; gap: 5px; align-content: start; min-width: 0; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.4"><span style="font: 500 11.5px/1.4 var(--mono); color: var(--accent-ink)">4</span><code style="font: 500 12px/1.4 var(--mono); overflow-wrap: anywhere">evaluate.py --smoke</code><span style="color: var(--muted)">Metrics and summary</span></div>
                    <span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; align-self: center; font: 500 15px/1 var(--mono); color: var(--muted)"><i class="arr"></i></span>
                    <div style="flex: var(--f-item); border: 1px solid var(--ink); background: var(--card); padding: 10px; display: grid; gap: 6px; align-content: start; min-width: 0; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.4"><code style="font: 500 12px/1.4 var(--mono); overflow-wrap: anywhere">reports/latest.md</code><div style="display: flex; gap: 4px"><span style="font: 500 11px/1 var(--mono); padding: 4px 6px; background: var(--good); color: var(--paper)">PASS</span><span style="font: 500 11px/1 var(--mono); padding: 4px 6px; background: var(--bad); color: var(--paper)">FAIL</span></div><span style="color: var(--muted)">Provenance, one table per evalset, crop thumbnails</span></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <figcaption><strong>One smoke run.</strong> Earlier smoke faces, scores and results are deleted first, so a fixed bug can't pass on stale scores (<code>--keep</code> keeps them). Sampled datasets stay.</figcaption>
          </figure>
